Installing pdp11-as
===================

	./configure
	make
	make check
	make install

pdp11-as is plain C99 and has no dependencies beyond a C library.  It
builds under pcc, gcc, clang and tcc.

Targets: all, check, install, uninstall, clean, distclean, dist.

Standard configure options apply; --prefix=DIR relocates the installation,
and DESTDIR=DIR staging is honoured by `make install'.

The two programs install to separate locations, mirroring the V7 layout
(`as` in /bin, its pass-2 helper `as2` in /lib): `as` goes to $(bindir)
and `as2` to $(libexecdir).  `as` finds `as2` at run time -- via $AS2, a
sibling of the `as` it was invoked as, or the compiled-in $(libexecdir)
default -- so co-located and nonstandard layouts both work.
